  libc/BUILD.bazel:11: [file-less] "everything" has no files and is not selected by directory
  libc/BUILD.bazel:6: [include-hint] "__support_cpp_all" matches a --rename_strip_package_prefix; consider --include=__support_cpp_all or --include_name_prefix
